      "ticket_type": "upsell",
      "decision": "answered",
      "reply": "Hi Diego, thanks for asking. Pro Monthly costs 79 US dollars a month. It includes everything in Starter, plus a weekly group coaching call, the template library, and one project review a month. Pro Yearly is 790 US dollars a year, which is two months free.\n\nTo switch, log in and open Account, then Plan. Click \"Switch to Pro\" and pick monthly or yearly. The page shows the exact amount before you pay. When you move up, you pay only the difference for the days left in your current period, and your next payment is the new price.\n\nYou can read more on the plans page (https://kitebridge.example/plans) and the switch help page (https://kitebridge.example/help/switch).\n\nKitebridge Support",
